{"id":9158,"date":"2020-07-21T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2020-07-21T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/best-practices-navigating-the-contracting-credentialing-process-video\/"},"modified":"2024-10-04T19:19:32","modified_gmt":"2024-10-04T23:19:32","slug":"best-practices-navigating-the-contracting-credentialing-process-video","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/best-practices-navigating-the-contracting-credentialing-process-video\/","title":{"rendered":"[Webinar] Best Practices: Navigating the Contracting &#038; Credentialing Process"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9158\" class=\"elementor elementor-9158\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5de2540b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5de2540b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-408c966f\" data-id=\"408c966f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b53848e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3b53848e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"videoDivHolder\"><div><video poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MTAwMjIwNA_best-practices-navigating-contracting-credentialing-process_thumbnail.jpg\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MTAwMjIwNA_best-practices-navigating-contracting-credentialing-process.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\" \/> <\/video><\/div><\/div><p><style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/our-solutions\/therapy-billing-software\/\">Rethink billing software and services<\/a> can help save your ABA therapy practice, clinic or business time and money by increasing efficiency and automation by eliminating workarounds, excel spreadsheets and lost revenue potential.<\/p><p>From <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/our-solutions\/practice-management\/\">our scheduling<\/a> and billing synchronization, to easy reporting, business transparency, advanced reporting and compliance capabilities, you\u2019ll have all the tools you need at your disposal.<\/p><p>You can also fully outsource your billing efforts with Rethink if you\u2019d like. That all sounds great, right? But wait, there\u2019s more&#8230;<\/p><h2>New Partnership &amp; Webinar<\/h2><p>In case you missed it, we recently announced that MRC Billing has become part of Rethink Behavioral Health.<\/p><p>This new partnership further expands our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/5-tips-for-moving-away-from-manual-aba-therapy-billing\/\">Revenue Cycle Management (RCM) services<\/a> by enabling us to offer Enrollment Services for a seamless credentialing and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/best-practices-in-insurance-contracting\/\">contracting process<\/a>.<\/p><p>To celebrate, we hosted a webinar with Monica M. Hammel, who is now the Enrollment Manager at Rethink Billing (formerly MRC Billing) to discuss the following.<\/p><ul><li>What you need to do to become contracted<\/li><li>What is a CAQH and what exactly is credentialing?<\/li><li>What to expect from the insurance companies<\/li><li>Types of contracts<\/li><li>Following up on your requests for contracts and credentialing<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15030,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Navigating the Contracting &amp; Credentialing Process","_seopress_titles_desc":"Best practices from our scheduling &amp; billing synchronization, to reporting, business transparency, advanced reporting &amp; compliance capabilities.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[69,74],"resource-tag":[],"class_list":["post-9158","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-business","resource-topic-insurance"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9158","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9158\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/15030"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.co